  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>A sandbox for<br><em>small, useful things.</em></h1>
      <p>NerveSocket is where I keep my nerdy experiments, mostly PHP and MySQL, and the tools that grew out of them. Poke around.</p>
      <p><a class="btn" href="#projects">See what's here</a></p>
    </section>

    <section id="projects">
      <h2>Projects</h2>
      <div class="grid">
                  <a class="card" href="/wall/">
            <h3>Social Wall</h3>
            <p>A stream of social posts.</p>
          </a>
                  <a class="card" href="/rsvp/">
            <h3>RSVP</h3>
            <p>Make an event, collect replies.</p>
          </a>
                  <a class="card" href="/yt/">
            <h3>YT DL</h3>
            <p>Grab video for offline use.</p>
          </a>
                  <a class="card" href="/paste/">
            <h3>Paste Bin</h3>
            <p>Quick text and code snippets.</p>
          </a>
                  <a class="card" href="https://hashex.ca/">
            <h3>HashEx</h3>
            <p>Hashtag Exchange game.</p>
          </a>
                  <a class="card" href="/mastodontags/">
            <h3>Mastodon Tags</h3>
            <p>Hashtag relationships in the fediverse.</p>
          </a>
                  <a class="card" href="https://img.nervesocket.com/">
            <h3>Image Hosting</h3>
            <p>Drop an image, get a link.</p>
          </a>
                  <a class="card" href="https://loothunt.ca/">
            <h3>LootHunt</h3>
            <p>Organize a treasure hunt.</p>
          </a>
              </div>
    </section>

        <section id="lately" class="lately">
      <h2>Fresh Posts from Mastodon</h2>
      <div class="posts">
                    <article class="post">
          <div class="body"><p>Every time a <a class="mention hashtag" href="https://mastodon.nervesocket.com/tags/NoMansSky" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">#<span>NoMansSky</span></a> update comes out it's just like sure why not. My grandkids are going to be talking about the cool new update that just came out 😅 probably will put GTA inside NMS by that point</p></div>
            <footer>
            <a href="https://mastodon.nervesocket.com/@ThaMunsta/117524330216269834" rel="noopener"><time datetime="2026-10-29T13:02:44.492Z">1d ago</time></a>
    </footer>
  </article>
                    <article class="post">
          <div class="body"><p>Creepy morning. The fog was just low enough in some areas that the street lights looked like UFOs 😅 very on brand for spooky season 👻</p></div>
            <footer>
            <a href="https://mastodon.nervesocket.com/@ThaMunsta/117524021608003592" rel="noopener"><time datetime="2026-10-29T11:44:15.494Z">1d ago</time></a>
    </footer>
  </article>
                              <div class="thread">
              <div class="parent-box">
                  <article class="post post-parent">
          <div class="body"><p><span class="h-card"><a class="mention" href="https://mastodon.nervesocket.com/@ThaMunsta" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">@<span>ThaMunsta</span></a></span> Some people just want to watch the world burn</p></div>
            <footer>
      <span>@Rossireland@mastodon.social</span>      <a href="https://mastodon.social/@Rossireland/117521470014528954" rel="noopener"><time datetime="2026-10-29T00:55:21.000Z">1d ago</time></a>
    </footer>
  </article>
              </div>
              <div class="reply-arrow">&#8627; replied</div>
                <article class="post">
          <div class="body"><p><span class="h-card"><a class="mention" href="https://mastodon.social/@Rossireland" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">@<span>Rossireland</span></a></span> I looked up and saw knots. I laughed and looked out the window but the person beside me also was iPhone headphones in knots. I rolled my eye and across the isle was more! Surrounded I tell ya 🤣</p></div>
            <footer>
            <a href="https://mastodon.nervesocket.com/@ThaMunsta/117521477291167888" rel="noopener"><time datetime="2026-10-29T00:57:12.299Z">1d ago</time></a>
    </footer>
  </article>
            </div>
                              <article class="post">
          <div class="body"><p>People with tangled iPhone headphones on the train is a character type right? What's with that. I feel like people either carefully keep their headphones wrapped neatly or they end up with 3 inches of usable cable management from below the mic lol</p></div>
            <footer>
            <a href="https://mastodon.nervesocket.com/@ThaMunsta/117520657506974287" rel="noopener"><time datetime="2026-10-28T21:28:43.398Z">2d ago</time></a>
    </footer>
  </article>
                              <div class="thread">
              <div class="parent-box">
                  <article class="post post-parent">
          <div class="body"><p><span class="h-card"><a class="mention" href="https://mastodon.nervesocket.com/@ThaMunsta" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">@<span>ThaMunsta</span></a></span> still! When are they going to finish???</p><p>They need more trains on this line, by Brampton it’s packed</p></div>
            <footer>
      <span>@luci@twoot.site</span>      <a href="https://twoot.site/@luci/117512803857349108" rel="noopener"><time datetime="2026-10-27T12:11:26.000Z">3d ago</time></a>
    </footer>
  </article>
              </div>
              <div class="reply-arrow">&#8627; replied</div>
                <article class="post">
          <div class="body"><p><span class="h-card"><a class="mention" href="https://twoot.site/@luci" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">@<span>luci</span></a></span> I mean I think there is some confusion. Some of them announce platform construction but some announce platform <em>restrictions</em> which I think is more accurate. Guelph is the same. There's no construction. I think it's just some bureaucracy crap</p></div>
            <footer>
            <a href="https://mastodon.nervesocket.com/@ThaMunsta/117512826021993855" rel="noopener"><time datetime="2026-10-27T12:17:04.408Z">3d ago</time></a>
    </footer>
  </article>
